                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ccb155ee-40ed-4866-812c-650022cb949b",
                                "sense_id": "776e0877-97c3-3bdf-a64a-399c9811b608",
                                "text": "Тот, кото́рого спасли́, был и тепе́рь весь мо́крый, иззя́бший и изнемо́гший. От испу́га и от стра́шных уси́лий, он впал в беспа́мятство и для него́ бы́ло безразли́чно, кто спаса́л его́.",
                                "translation": "The man who had been saved was still quite wet, shivering and exhausted. From fright and owing to his terrible efforts he fell into a sort of unconsciousness, and it was quite indifferent to him who had saved him.",
                                "english": "The man who had been saved was still quite wet, shivering and exhausted. From fright and owing to his terrible efforts he fell into a sort of unconsciousness, and it was quite indifferent to him who had saved him."
